Z||000010||KnightRyder31||07-12-2000||02:57 PM||||The Fiero is one of the best damn automobiles on this planet! If you know know how to drive, then you could easily beat that stupid rice-burning peace of crap! What kind of forum is that??? Infact, what kind of a topic is that??? You would have to be a total dumb-a$$ to try and compair the great Fiero to a peace of jap-crap like a MR2. To tell you guys the truth, the only reason why I ever wanted a Fiero was because I thought it looked like a 80's model Lotus Espirt. But now that I actually own the Fiero, I feel that the Fiero is in a class of its own, its just un-touchable.<BR>Sorry about the length,<BR>Knight-||||reg||1
