Z||000019||Raydar||07-12-2000||10:47 PM||||I drove a 1st gen MR-2, shortly after they were released. I gotta tell ya', the only thing I have ever driven that handled like that was a friends Lotus Europa. I *was* impressed. <BR>Then I drove a new 85 GT. Bought it soon after. Main reason I bought the GT was because I was in the process of repairing my GF's 70 Cutlass, that she had driven into the back of a 66 Chevy. Found rust in that car in places that I never even <I>thought</I> about. I didn't care if I <I>never</I> had another metal bodied car. <BR>Oh yeah, there was the styling and that V-6 rumble.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero1a.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR><BR>Raydar<BR>88 Formula T-Top <BR>88 Coupe (ISO 3800)<P>"Some mornings, it just isn't worth<BR>chewing through the restraints."||||reg||1
